MODULE: ResolvedSameLogRebuildClears
TARGET: ResolvedRetained
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: Same-log candidate capture clears suppression even though the actual physical tail is unchanged
PERTURBS: Capture

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,owner,resolved,order,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,offsets,projections,liveBinding,durableBinding,candidate,outcome>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ resolved' = IF candidate = tail THEN FALSE ELSE resolved
    /\ order' = IF candidate = tail THEN <<>> ELSE order
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,owner,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,offsets,projections,liveBinding,durableBinding,candidate,outcome>>
--- END
